":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/84443c6a059552cb1ccb063228622b23977376ab/ss_84443c6a059552cb1ccb063228622b23977376ab.600x338.jpg?t=1757067414"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/c94c61a2576a21417357d1f3333d4571c6b039e8/ss_c94c61a2576a21417357d1f3333d4571c6b039e8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757067414","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514440/c94c61a2576a21417357d1f3333d4571c6b039e8/ss_c94c61a2576a21417357d1f3333d4571c6b039e8.600x338.jpg?t=1757067414"}],"short_description":"Compact, tactical, rogue-lite, 2d extraction with pixelized graphics and a dark, gritty tone.\u00a0\u00a0Gather all the resources you can and customize your loadout- you must evolve with every death to fight through the horrors that await you. This is No Time For Pants!","steam_appid":3514440,"support_info":{"email":"pixelpushinc@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.notimeforpants.com/"}